  "name": "async_ssl",
  "description": "An asynchronous, non-blocking OCaml interface to OpenSSL integrated with the Jane Street Async library. It utilizes ctypes for type-safe FFI and provides high-level pipe-based abstractions for SSL/TLS client-server communication. The project features robust certificate handling, SNI support, and RFC 3526 MODP group implementations for secure key exchange.",
